{
  "_comment": [
    "One entry per source. 'kind' is either 'scrape' or 'rss'.",
    "For scrape sources, selectors are CSS. 'item' is the repeating element;",
    "'link', 'title' and 'date' are looked up INSIDE each item.",
    "If 'title' is omitted, the link's own text is used.",
    "Run  python3 ingest.py --inspect <name>  to help work out selectors for a new site.",
    "Prysmian is confirmed working. The others are stubs - fill in selectors as you verify them."
